{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:01:56+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-13T17:01:56+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Hannover Rück SE","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Reinsurance","country":"Germany","city":"Hanover","website":"https://www.hannover-re.com","employees":3732,"summary":"Hannover Rück SE, together with its subsidiaries, provides reinsurance products and services in Germany, the United Kingdom, France, Europe, the United States, Asia, Australia, Africa, and internationally. It operates through Property & Casualty Reinsurance; and Life & Health Reinsurance segments. The company provides property and casualty reinsurance solutions for agricultural, livestock, and bloodstock; aviation and space; natural catastrophe; credit, surety, and political risks; cyber; digital; marine and upstream energy; natural catastrophes; advanced and facultative business, insurance-linked securities and structured reinsurance; and parametric solutions. It also offers risk solutions in the areas of critical illness, disability, health, longevity, long term care, and mortality. In addition, the company offers group life, retirement, lifestyle, credit life, and Takaful reinsurance products. Further, the company provides various financial solutions, including new-business financing; monetization of embedded value; reserve and solvency relief; and reinsurance and solvency II businesses. The company was formerly known as Hannover Rückversicherung AG and changed its name to Hannover Rück SE in March 2013. Hannover Rück SE was founded in 1966 and is based in Hanover, Germany. Hannover Rück SE operates as a subsidiary of Talanx AG.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Hannover Rck SE, avec ses filiales, fournit des produits et services de réassurance en Allemagne, au Royaume-Uni, en France, en Europe, aux États-Unis, en Asie, en Australie, en Afrique et à l'international. Elle opère par l'intermédiaire des secteurs de la réassurance de biens et de dommages et de la réassurance vie et santé. La société fournit des solutions de réassurance de biens et de dommages pour l'agriculture, l'élevage et les actions sang; l'aviation et l'espace; catastrophes naturelles; risques de crédit, de cautionnement et politiques; cyber; numérique; énergie marine et en amont; catastrophes naturelles; affaires avancées et facultatives, titres liés à l'assurance et réassurance structurée; et solutions paramétriques."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":36130902016,"shares_outstanding":120597134,"trailing_pe":12.913793,"forward_pe":12.488651,"price_to_book":2.6436772,"ev_to_ebitda":9.567,"ev_to_revenue":1.429,"dividend_yield":0.0424,"payout_ratio":0.5428,"beta_yahoo":0.09},"targets":{"current_price":299.6,"mean":285.46667,"median":280.0,"high":340.0,"low":251.0,"n_analysts":15,"reco_mean":2.53333,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-09"],"eps_avg":5.65364,"eps_low":4.87,"eps_high":5.61699,"revenue_avg":7220432930,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-07","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.50200003,"institutions_pct":0.29644,"institutions_float_pct":0.59526,"institutions_n":442,"institutions":[{"name":"Paradigm Asset Management Company, LLC","pct":0.0001,"shares":9100,"value":2726360,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":1.0222},{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":747,"value":223801,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.021}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0073,"shares":885063,"value":265164880,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0061000003},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0049,"shares":587818,"value":176110276,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0114},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0038,"shares":454225,"value":136085812,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0185},{"name":"Fidel